        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A glass that reveals the truth.\nIt is a mysterious glass that returns\na Pokémon back to its original shape.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "しんじつを　うつしだすことで\nポケモンを　ほんらいの　すがたに\nかえてしまう　ふしぎな　かがみ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "진실을 비춰줌으로\n포켓몬을 본래의 모습으로\n바꿔버리는 이상한 거울.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mystérieux miroir qui, en reflétant la vérité,\npermet de redonner à un Pokémon sa forme\noriginelle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mysteriöser Spiegel, der Pokémon in\nihre eigentliche Form verwandelt, indem er\ndie Wahrheit widerspiegelt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Gardevoir en combate.",
